stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unbuilt
    Unbuilt --> Initialized : build() 实例化<br/>initialize(context) 调一次
    Initialized --> Active : 进入管线
    Active --> Active : ingest / query 反复 execute()
    Active --> Shutdown : MCS.shutdown()<br/>每实例一次 · 共享插件不重复
    Shutdown --> [*]

    note right of Initialized
        一次性准备：访问 graph / config
        如 IndexInterface.build
    end note

    note right of Active
        写 / 读两套 PluginManager 复用同一实例
        共享插件(NODE_EXTENSION / LLM)同实例注册两侧
    end note

    note right of Shutdown
        幂等：共享插件只 shutdown 一次
    end note

    classDef ruleState fill:#E6E6FA,stroke:#333,color:#4b0082
    classDef gateState fill:#90EE90,stroke:#333,color:#003300
    classDef llmState fill:#FFD700,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef endState fill:#D3D3D3,stroke:#333,color:#333

    class Unbuilt ruleState
    class Initialized gateState
    class Active llmState
    class Shutdown endState
